  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **I'm in Your Mind** (2 reviews): A tease at 1:26 is the 1895 track \"Streets of Cairo\"; The band teased \"The Dripping Tap\" around the two-minute mark [3][4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2023-01-06** (recommended): audience recording; 9 songs; 86 min; rated 3.33/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Weather forced the venue change from Bowl of Brooklands to TSB Stadium [1]\n- A pause occurred mid-song to celebrate Sam Joseph's birthday [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2023-01-06**: taped by Scott Rief \"scizzardland\"; source: AUD > IPhone MOV. > Handbrake > WAV > Audacity [1]. Also: Scott Rief recorded the concert and sent the footage for editing [1]",
